					"text": {
						"type": "string",
						"value": "COLORIZE\n\nThe Colorize node gives color to the incoming texture. \nThe node can operate in color or palette mode.\n\nIn color mode the color can be set manually or by connecting a color type value into the color inlet.\nIn palette mode you feed the palette inlet a Texture2Drgba value and the colors in that texture will be used to colorize the incoming texture."
					}
				},
